docs {
  # Batch Confirm Presigned Uploads (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/confirm-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Confirms multiple direct client uploads. Verifies each object in storage, queries file sizes and ETags, and inserts all records in PostgreSQL.
}
